WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.000 --> 00:00:05.500
[Eerie and atmospheric woodwind melody playing]

00:00:06.000 --> 00:00:10.500
Welcome to AniVerse - Dubbed Animation & Comics Experience

00:00:11.000 --> 00:00:15.800
Wirt: Oh gosh, Greg, where are we? I think we are completely lost in this forest.

00:00:16.200 --> 00:00:21.000
Greg: Don't worry, Wirt! All we have to do is keep moving forward!

00:00:21.500 --> 00:00:26.500
Wirt: Look at these old ancient trees... The air feels chilly and uncanny.

00:00:27.000 --> 00:00:32.000
Greg: I have a special rock in my pocket, it's called a rock fact! Want to hear one?

00:00:33.000 --> 00:00:38.500
Woods职责/Woodsmen: Halt, travelers! Beware of the Beast lurking in the woods!

00:00:39.000 --> 00:00:44.000
Wirt: The Beast?! What kind of beast are you talking about, sir?

00:00:44.500 --> 00:00:50.000
Woodsmen: The Beast who claims despairing souls and turns wanderers into Edelwood trees...

00:00:51.000 --> 00:00:57.000
[Rustling wind through autumn branches and lantern glow]

00:00:58.000 --> 00:01:05.000
Beatrice: Hey there! Do you two lost boys need a guide through the Unknown?

00:01:06.000 --> 00:01:12.000
Greg: A talking bluebird! That is so cool! Do you know how to get back home?

00:01:13.000 --> 00:01:20.000
Beatrice: Perhaps, if you promise not to cause trouble with the good witch of the forest...
